5️⃣ State Management — When NOT to Use NgRx

I avoid NgRx when:
	•	App is medium size
	•	No complex shared state
	•	No multi-user sync
	•	No undo/redo requirements

Use NgRx when:
	•	Complex cross-feature shared state
	•	Real-time collaboration
	•	Audit logs
	•	Event sourcing style architecture

Otherwise:
	•	Services + Signals is enough

